note_text = "GRUG COUNTY ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
DISRUPTIVE CLASSROOM BEHAVIOR
INSTRUCTOR NOTICE OF SUSPENSION LETTER

Date: 11/20/2026

Dear Parent/Guardian,

Your child has started, a fire on the curtains in the classroom. This behavior is inappropriate in class and you are in violation of the Stanwdards of Conduct established by the Grug County Board Policy BP-5500. Specifically, it appears you have violated our contraband policy. As a consequence, your child is hereby suspended from this school for five consecutive days. A suspension does not excuse your child from completing work.

Sincerely,

Dr. Matthew "

